WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.968
-Fox News has apparently barred

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:05.801
its own anchors from covering
a billion-dollar lawsuit

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.267
against the company
that revealed

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:10.133
its on-air personalities
knowingly lied to their viewers

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:11.434
about the 2020 election.

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:14.367
Meanwhile, Fox also gave airtime
to Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.901
to defend her call
for a national divorce

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:18.334
between red states
and blue states.

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:20.334
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:24.501
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:26.968
You will often hear those
on the right say

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.234
that the so-called elite
corporate media lies

00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:31.968
to its viewers, although, I
personally find it a little odd

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.300
that they complain
about the media

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.434
being corporate elitist
when their favorite network

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:37.501
has a giant headquarters
in midtown Manhattan

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:39.767
and is owned
by a mega corporation run

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:42.801
by a media mogul who is one
of the world's richest oligarchs

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:46.067
and the main villain from the
second "Crocodile Dundee" movie.

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:47.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.701
[ Australian accent ]
Yes, I can see that's a knife,

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:50.234
nut I'll tell my viewers
it's not a knife.

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:51.434
Who do you think they're going
to believe?

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:53.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:55.067
Now, obviously,
I'm not going to say

00:00:55.067 --> 00:00:56.767
the media never
gets stories wrong

00:00:56.767 --> 00:00:58.033
or that you can't disagree
with them.

00:00:58.033 --> 00:00:59.834
You can,
as Senator Bernie Sanders

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:01.834
did recently,
without even saying a word.

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:05.067
-We also have one of the most
innovative healthcare systems,

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:08.234
when it comes to creation
of pharmaceutical drugs.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.534
[ Laughter ]
You are doing this.

00:01:09.534 --> 00:01:11.801
-Bernie --
[ Applause ]

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:16.501
Bernie uses his index finger
the way a samurai uses a sword.

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:19.300
[ Laughter ]
If he raises it,
he has to wag it.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.934
[ Laughter ]
You know, by law,

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.634
he actually has
to carry a license for it

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.400
and keep it in a tiny,
little holster.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:27.267
What I appreciate about Bernie

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:28.868
is that there's just
no guile with him.

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:31.267
It's the opposite
of a Jedi mind trick.

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:35.167
If Bernie had been in that
cruiser with C-3PO and R2-D2,

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:36.901
the scene would've gone
much differently.

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:39.601
[ As Sanders ]
These are, in fact,
the droids you're looking for,

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:41.968
but I'm not going to let you
take them, and here's why.

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:45.434
The top 1% of stormtroopers
already have 99% of the droids.

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:47.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:49.901
[ Cheering ]
But there is --

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:52.400
there is a massive difference
between criticizing the media

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.267
for limiting the scope of debate

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:56.467
and claiming journalists,
as a whole,

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:58.367
are engaged
in a broad conspiracy

00:01:58.367 --> 00:02:00.067
to lie to people,
as Bernie explained.

00:02:00.067 --> 00:02:01.968
-Do you worry, when you talk
about the corporate media,

00:02:01.968 --> 00:02:03.601
that you are targeting

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:05.334
journalists when you say that?
-No, no.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.934
Donald Trump talks
about fake news

00:02:06.934 --> 00:02:09.000
and that's simply
to deflect attention

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.267
from the fact that he's
a pathological liar.

00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:13.000
My experience,
one-on-one with media,

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.667
they work hard,
very rarely am I misquoted.

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:17.801
But what I am talking about,
Margaret,

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:20.501
is that corporate media limits

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:22.734
the kind of debate
that we have in this country.

00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:25.000
-Mm-hmm.
-You tell me. You know more
about it than I do.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.467
How often do we talk about
income and wealth inequality?

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:29.234
-We're talking about it
right now, Senator!

00:02:29.234 --> 00:02:30.400
-Yeah, but how often?

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.534
Not everybody has Bernie Sanders
on your show.

00:02:32.534 --> 00:02:34.534
[ Laughter ]
-And, you know,
Bernie will go on any show,

00:02:34.534 --> 00:02:36.701
if you're willing to let him
talk about income inequality.

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:39.100
Bernie would fully do
"The Masked Singer,"

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.033
if it meant...

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:41.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.100
...getting his message out.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:43.968
[ As Sanders ]
Bravo. Good guess.

00:02:43.968 --> 00:02:45.367
But now, the bad news.

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:47.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.000
Anyway, the point is,
there's a difference

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.300
between good faith
media criticism

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.868
and claiming journalists
are engaged

00:02:52.868 --> 00:02:54.834
in a nefarious conspiracy
of lies,

00:02:54.834 --> 00:02:56.234
as the right often does.

00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:58.601
In fact, as it turns out,
they're the ones

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:00.234
knowingly lying
to their viewers,

00:03:00.234 --> 00:03:02.267
as we found out
from a recent court filing

00:03:02.267 --> 00:03:05.167
and a billion-dollar defamation
suit against Fox News.

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:07.734
-A stunning new court filing
revealing how top talent

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:09.501
and executives at Fox News

00:03:09.501 --> 00:03:12.400
trashed Donald Trump
and ridiculed his legal team

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.868
and their 2020 election
conspiracies behind the cameras,

00:03:15.868 --> 00:03:18.234
all while hyping those
same conspiracies on the air,

00:03:18.234 --> 00:03:19.501
to their viewers.

00:03:19.501 --> 00:03:23.534
-Fox staff were privately
blasting the Big Lie as BS

00:03:23.534 --> 00:03:26.367
and saying, "mind blowingly
nuts," "reckless."

00:03:26.367 --> 00:03:28.968
-As Trump lawyers Rudy Giuliani
and Sidney Powell

00:03:28.968 --> 00:03:32.601
were making wildly false claims
about rigged voting machines

00:03:32.601 --> 00:03:35.334
after Trump lost in 2020,

00:03:35.334 --> 00:03:38.634
private communications reveal
that pro-Trump voices

00:03:38.634 --> 00:03:41.400
at Fox News
were calling it nuts.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.000
"Watching Giuliani!,"
Rupert wrote in an email...

00:03:49.167 --> 00:03:50.300
...Tucker Carlson wrote

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.400
to fellow Fox host
Laura Ingraham.

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.067
Ingraham responded...

00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:05.133
...said Fox host Sean Hannity...

00:04:07.567 --> 00:04:09.567
They were all
communicating privately

00:04:09.567 --> 00:04:11.100
about how insane
the Big Lie was,

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.567
while turning around and hyping
that lie to their viewers,

00:04:13.567 --> 00:04:16.234
When I first read those quotes,
I was honestly speechless.

00:04:16.234 --> 00:04:18.234
I just wish I had a way
to communicate

00:04:18.234 --> 00:04:20.267
my disapproval without words.

00:04:20.267 --> 00:04:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.067
Oh!

00:04:23.067 --> 00:04:25.067
[ Applause ]
Senator, please,

00:04:25.067 --> 00:04:26.701
put that finger back
in its holster!

00:04:26.701 --> 00:04:28.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:30.267
You know, when he's
over my shoulder like that,

00:04:30.267 --> 00:04:31.501
he looks like the Angel Bernie,

00:04:31.501 --> 00:04:33.200
telling me not
to do something bad.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.601
[ Laughter ]
Angel Bernie,

00:04:34.601 --> 00:04:35.901
should I lie to my viewers

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:38.067
and tell them Trump
won the election?

00:04:38.067 --> 00:04:39.734
[ Laughter ]
Oh.

00:04:39.734 --> 00:04:42.267
Oh, that must mean there's
a Devil Bernie on my other side,

00:04:42.267 --> 00:04:43.567
telling me to go for it.

00:04:43.567 --> 00:04:45.234
Let's see.
Devil Bernie,

00:04:45.234 --> 00:04:48.067
should I lie to my viewers
for ratings?

00:04:48.067 --> 00:04:49.734
[ Laughter ]
Oh.

00:04:49.734 --> 00:04:51.200
Oh, no.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.701
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.701 --> 00:04:55.667
You guys, this is what happens
when we take a week off.

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:57.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.601 --> 00:05:00.334
We lose our focus and we have
two Bernies onscreen

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:01.567
at the same time.

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:03.000
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.968
The point is the very same
Fox News anchors who constantly

00:05:05.968 --> 00:05:07.968
accuse the so-called
mainstream media of lying

00:05:07.968 --> 00:05:09.467
were themselves lying
to their viewers

00:05:09.467 --> 00:05:10.834
and were admitting,
behind closed doors,

00:05:10.834 --> 00:05:11.934
that they were lying
to their viewers.

00:05:11.934 --> 00:05:14.434
And the supposed evidence
they were getting

00:05:14.434 --> 00:05:15.567
for all these claims

00:05:15.567 --> 00:05:17.701
was transparently insane
on its face.

00:05:17.701 --> 00:05:20.601
-Before one interview with Trump
lawyer Sidney Powell,

00:05:20.601 --> 00:05:24.467
in advance, she told Fox
that her single source

00:05:24.467 --> 00:05:29.100
for these election claims was
a person who does

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:32.033
"time-travel
in a semi-conscious state."

00:05:32.033 --> 00:05:33.367
[ Laughter and cheering ]
Let me repeat that.

00:05:33.367 --> 00:05:36.801
Their source, now at the heart
of this defamation claim,

00:05:36.801 --> 00:05:39.734
at a time when the lies led
to violence,

00:05:39.734 --> 00:05:42.167
was someone who said
they knew what they knew

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:44.634
because they got it
by experiencing

00:05:44.634 --> 00:05:46.701
"time-travel
in a semi-conscious state."

00:05:46.701 --> 00:05:49.667
[ Laughter ]
-If Sidney Powell had
a time-traveling friend,

00:05:49.667 --> 00:05:50.701
why didn't they tell her

00:05:50.701 --> 00:05:52.534
turtleneck sweaters were
out of style?

00:05:52.534 --> 00:05:53.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:53.968 --> 00:05:56.000
Fun fact -- Sidney wore that
outfit at the press conference

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.334
where Rudy's head started
to leak.

00:05:57.334 --> 00:05:58.267
You guys remember that?

00:05:58.267 --> 00:05:59.801
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.801 --> 00:06:01.767
A day professional hair
and makeup artists

00:06:01.767 --> 00:06:03.601
now refer to
as their Pearl Harbor.

00:06:03.601 --> 00:06:05.701
[ Laughter and cheering ]
Of course, Rudy doesn't use

00:06:05.701 --> 00:06:07.234
professional hair
and makeup artists.

00:06:07.234 --> 00:06:09.467
[ As Giuliani ]
I save so much money
when I do it myself.

00:06:09.467 --> 00:06:10.767
[ Laughter ]
"Um, Rudy,

00:06:10.767 --> 00:06:12.267
one of your eyes fell off."

00:06:12.267 --> 00:06:14.367
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.367 --> 00:06:16.267
Double-sided tape, my ass!

00:06:16.267 --> 00:06:19.667
[ Laughter ]
And can I say, if Fox News
had a time traveler,

00:06:19.667 --> 00:06:20.934
I always thought
it would be Rudy.

00:06:20.934 --> 00:06:22.367
I mean, look at him.
He always looks like

00:06:22.367 --> 00:06:24.267
he just got back
from the year 3,000.

00:06:24.267 --> 00:06:28.033
[ Laughter ]
Of course, in Rudy's version
of "Back to the Future,"

00:06:28.033 --> 00:06:30.601
he travels back in time to make
sure his parents never met.

00:06:30.601 --> 00:06:32.133
[ As Giuliani ]
If they never marry,
my first wife

00:06:32.133 --> 00:06:33.667
won't legally be
my second cousin.

00:06:33.667 --> 00:06:36.434
[ Laughter ]
"Yeah, but,

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:38.467
Rudy, if they never meet,
you'll never be born."

00:06:38.467 --> 00:06:40.434
I'll cross the bridge
when I come to it.

00:06:40.434 --> 00:06:41.868
[ Laughter ]

00:06:41.868 --> 00:06:43.367
But that's right --
Fox aired an interview

00:06:43.367 --> 00:06:45.267
with a crazy person
who told them, in advance,

00:06:45.267 --> 00:06:47.501
that her only source
for her election fraud claims

00:06:47.501 --> 00:06:48.634
was someone who supposedly

00:06:48.634 --> 00:06:50.367
time traveled
in a semi-conscious state.

00:06:50.367 --> 00:06:51.767
Was there any follow-up?

00:06:51.767 --> 00:06:53.367
"Man, Sidney, it would help

00:06:53.367 --> 00:06:54.901
if you had
a second source here."

00:06:54.901 --> 00:06:56.634
[ As Powell ]
I have a haunted antique doll

00:06:56.634 --> 00:06:58.234
[ Laughter ]
who sometimes speaks to me,

00:06:58.234 --> 00:06:59.868
but sadly,
she's pretty convinced

00:06:59.868 --> 00:07:01.567
Biden won fair and square.

00:07:01.567 --> 00:07:04.868
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, she's being
a real bitch about it!

00:07:04.868 --> 00:07:07.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:07.033 --> 00:07:09.200
My favorite part of that time
travel story, by the way,

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.234
is that the Fox anchor
who received that information

00:07:11.234 --> 00:07:13.367
then passed it along
to the Trump family.

00:07:13.367 --> 00:07:15.467
-Not only did they air that,
but the host,

00:07:15.467 --> 00:07:18.067
Maria Bartiromo,
welcomed that lawyer Powell,

00:07:18.067 --> 00:07:21.801
knowing that she had
this made-up conspiracy theory.

00:07:21.801 --> 00:07:25.200
And then that's not all.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:29.167
The Fox anchor then
steps in as a conduit

00:07:29.167 --> 00:07:33.033
to take that information back
to Trump family members,

00:07:33.033 --> 00:07:35.501
responding to the lawyer Powell,

00:07:35.501 --> 00:07:39.267
that she shared this important
"info with Eric Trump."

00:07:39.267 --> 00:07:41.000
-Man, if there's anyone
in the Trump family

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.200
[ Laughter ]
who would be excited

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:44.100
to hear that time travel
is real,

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:46.033
[ Laughter and applause ]
it would be Eric Trump.

00:07:46.033 --> 00:07:48.133
[ As Eric ]
Thank you for sharing
this important info, Maria.

00:07:48.133 --> 00:07:49.968
I will use it
to travel back in time

00:07:49.968 --> 00:07:51.534
wearing a mask
of my father's face,

00:07:51.534 --> 00:07:53.634
to have a catch
with my seven-year-old self.

00:07:53.634 --> 00:07:56.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:56.467 --> 00:07:58.367
I think that will fix
everything!

00:07:59.601 --> 00:08:01.634
I will also intercept
and replace that birthday card

00:08:01.634 --> 00:08:03.567
he once gave me that said...

00:08:03.567 --> 00:08:05.100
[ Laughter ]

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:07.033
Why does Hallmark
even make those?!

00:08:07.033 --> 00:08:08.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:08.667 --> 00:08:10.968
The lawsuit also alleges
that Trump himself tried

00:08:10.968 --> 00:08:12.834
to call into Fox on January 6th,

00:08:12.834 --> 00:08:14.501
but that Fox refused
to put him on-air,

00:08:14.501 --> 00:08:15.801
presumably because they knew

00:08:15.801 --> 00:08:17.200
what he was saying
was dangerous.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:17.868
According to CNN...

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:32.000
[ Laughter ]
That is the most polite
euphemism I've ever heard.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.133
[ Laughter ]
That's like Hannibal Lecter

00:08:34.133 --> 00:08:36.300
describing himself
in his Tinder bio as a...

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:40.067 --> 00:08:42.868
So, Fox knew this was all BS

00:08:42.868 --> 00:08:44.801
and yet, they were hiding it
to their viewers, anyway.

00:08:44.801 --> 00:08:48.400
In fact, they were even trying
to punish others at the network

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.701
who dared to correct the record.

00:08:49.701 --> 00:08:51.901
-When Trump falsely claimed
that Dominion machines

00:08:51.901 --> 00:08:54.467
cost him 2.7 million votes,

00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:56.968
Fox reporter Jacqui Heinrich
responded

00:08:56.968 --> 00:08:58.267
with a tweet saying...

00:09:03.434 --> 00:09:05.300
Some of Heinrich's
colleagues at Fox

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:06.968
wanted her to be punished,

00:09:06.968 --> 00:09:09.734
even though they knew that
what she was saying was true.

00:09:12.534 --> 00:09:15.734
...Tucker Carlson wrote hosts
Laura Ingraham and Sean Hannity.

00:09:23.868 --> 00:09:26.200
-So, next time Tucker rails
against corporate media,

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.601
remember, he does the news

00:09:27.601 --> 00:09:29.267
with one eye
on the stock ticker.

00:09:29.267 --> 00:09:31.534
[ Laughter ]
He's always checking
on Fox's stock price,

00:09:31.534 --> 00:09:33.133
as well as his other
investments,

00:09:33.133 --> 00:09:34.267
like the Bow Tie Emporium

00:09:34.267 --> 00:09:35.601
and [Bleep] M&amp;M's.

00:09:35.601 --> 00:09:37.834
[ Laughter and applause ]
But...

00:09:37.834 --> 00:09:39.467
Tucker isn't news.

00:09:39.467 --> 00:09:42.067
He's entertainment
and he knows his audience

00:09:42.067 --> 00:09:44.167
doesn't want the truth.
They want their stories.

00:09:44.167 --> 00:09:47.200
Tucker Telling the truth
would be like Kylo Ren

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.334
turning to camera
mid-threatening monologue

00:09:49.334 --> 00:09:51.033
and saying,
"I'm not really Kylo Ren.

00:09:51.033 --> 00:09:52.501
I'm Adam Driver.
You guys know me.

00:09:52.501 --> 00:09:55.634
[ Laughter ]

00:09:55.634 --> 00:09:57.000
From 'Girls.'
None of this is real.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.000
It's just for fun.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:58.767
[ Laughter ]

00:09:58.767 --> 00:10:00.634
Anyway, back to 'space.'"

00:10:00.634 --> 00:10:04.467
[ Laughter ]

00:10:04.467 --> 00:10:06.267
Fox viewers didn't want
the truth then,

00:10:06.267 --> 00:10:07.667
and they don't
want the truth now,

00:10:07.667 --> 00:10:10.133
which is why no one on Fox
is talking about the lawsuit.

00:10:10.133 --> 00:10:11.801
Yesterday, one of their anchors
said on-air

00:10:11.801 --> 00:10:14.334
that the company had told him
he couldn't cover the lawsuit,

00:10:14.334 --> 00:10:15.734
despite his strong objections.

00:10:15.734 --> 00:10:17.701
-Some of you have been asking
why I'm not covering

00:10:17.701 --> 00:10:20.367
the Dominion voting machines
lawsuit against Fox,

00:10:20.367 --> 00:10:23.234
involving the unproven claims
of election fraud in 2020,

00:10:23.234 --> 00:10:25.234
and it's absolutely
a fair question.

00:10:25.234 --> 00:10:26.334
I believe I should be
covering it --

00:10:26.334 --> 00:10:27.767
it's a major media story --

00:10:27.767 --> 00:10:29.133
given my role here at FOX.

00:10:29.133 --> 00:10:30.734
But the company
has decided that,

00:10:30.734 --> 00:10:32.801
as part of the organization
being sued,

00:10:32.801 --> 00:10:35.968
I can't talk about it or write
about it, at least for now.

00:10:35.968 --> 00:10:37.334
I strongly disagree
with that decision,

00:10:37.334 --> 00:10:39.400
but as an employee,
I have to abide by it

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.501
and, if that changes,
I'll let you know.

00:10:41.501 --> 00:10:43.901
-So, Fox is censoring
its own anchors now.

00:10:43.901 --> 00:10:46.167
What's next, are they going
to replace Sean Hannity

00:10:46.167 --> 00:10:47.567
with that Microsoft chat box

00:10:47.567 --> 00:10:49.400
that started going haywire
on everyone?

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.968
[ Laughter ]
What are they going to do,
program it

00:10:50.968 --> 00:10:53.033
to say the word woke
over and over?

00:10:53.033 --> 00:10:55.334
[ Laughter ]
-Welcome to "Hannity."
Tonight's top story --

00:10:55.334 --> 00:10:57.033
woke LEGOs are taking over.

00:10:57.033 --> 00:10:58.834
Woke M&amp;M's, woke textbooks,

00:10:58.834 --> 00:11:01.133
woke Potato Head,
woke Dr. Seuss.

00:11:01.133 --> 00:11:03.868
Woke, woke, woke, woke,
woke, woke, woke, woke.

00:11:03.868 --> 00:11:06.234
[ Laughter ]
And yet, none of these
revelations seem

00:11:06.234 --> 00:11:07.601
to have changed anything
over at Fox.

00:11:07.601 --> 00:11:09.033
They're still doing
their usual thing.

00:11:09.033 --> 00:11:10.267
Just last week, they gave

00:11:10.267 --> 00:11:12.234
Republican Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:11:12.234 --> 00:11:13.667
extensive airtime to explain

00:11:13.667 --> 00:11:15.968
her unhinged call
for a "national divorce,"

00:11:15.968 --> 00:11:19.367
which, she said, would separate
red states from blue states.

00:11:19.367 --> 00:11:22.467
-I don't see middle ground
on a lot of these issues,

00:11:22.467 --> 00:11:25.267
so, what is the other answer,
if it's not a divorce?

00:11:27.501 --> 00:11:28.934
-Well, exactly, Sean.

00:11:28.934 --> 00:11:31.033
That's the problem
and where we are today.

00:11:31.033 --> 00:11:34.067
And, in my life, in my world,

00:11:34.067 --> 00:11:36.300
all of my friends
are regular Americans.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.000
Everyone I talk to is sick
and tired and fed up

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.367
of being bullied by the left,
abused by the left,

00:11:43.367 --> 00:11:45.467
and disrespected by the left.

00:11:45.467 --> 00:11:49.100
And our ideas, our policies,
our ways of life

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.200
have become so far apart

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.601
that it's just coming
to that point.

00:11:53.601 --> 00:11:55.701
-And do you expect it'll happen?
Last question.

00:11:55.701 --> 00:11:58.167
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]

00:11:58.167 --> 00:12:01.100
[ Laughter ]
-Well, I think it's something
that we should work towards

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.434
because, you know,
it's kind of the vision

00:12:03.434 --> 00:12:06.033
that our founding fathers had
for America.

00:12:06.033 --> 00:12:09.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:09.901 --> 00:12:11.934
-A national divorce?

00:12:11.934 --> 00:12:14.167
[ Laughter ]
[ As Greene ] A national divorce

00:12:14.167 --> 00:12:15.868
was the vision
of the Founding Fathers!

00:12:15.868 --> 00:12:18.934
I know because I time traveled
in a semi-conscious state

00:12:18.934 --> 00:12:20.267
and talked to them.

00:12:20.267 --> 00:12:21.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:21.801 --> 00:12:23.634
How about this?
Instead of a compromise --

00:12:23.634 --> 00:12:25.901
This will be the compromise --
instead of red states

00:12:25.901 --> 00:12:27.033
getting a divorce
from blue states,

00:12:27.033 --> 00:12:28.701
America gets a divorce
from Greene.

00:12:28.701 --> 00:12:30.667
She's definitely dressed for it.
Remember when she showed up

00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:31.868
to the state of the union,

00:12:31.868 --> 00:12:33.834
screaming at Joe Biden
in a white fur collar,

00:12:33.834 --> 00:12:36.868
like she was demanding sole
custody of the Maltese?

00:12:36.868 --> 00:12:39.100
[ Laughter ]
[ As Greene ] You hand over
Clarabelle right now!

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:43.868
[ Laughter ]
I'm the one who fed her organic
chow and put bows in her hair!

00:12:43.868 --> 00:12:46.634
[ Laughter ]
The Dominion lawsuit
has exposed, yet again,

00:12:46.634 --> 00:12:48.033
that the people
who constantly accuse

00:12:48.033 --> 00:12:50.167
the rest of the media of lying
are themselves the ones

00:12:50.167 --> 00:12:52.200
who knowingly lied
to their viewers.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.868
They took their cues from,
among others,

00:12:53.868 --> 00:12:55.834
a guy who always looks like
he's about to...

00:12:55.834 --> 00:12:57.801
-Time-travel
in a semi-conscious state.

00:12:57.801 --> 00:12:59.701
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:59.701 --> 00:13:03.467
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

